{
  "$comment": "POI classification schema (PLAN.md §9, §11; decision record 0003). A matcher matches when every listed key is present with one of the listed values ('*' = any value) and no key in its 'not' map carries a listed value. 'skip' matchers drop a feature from every class (not from exclusions or terrain). Classes are ranked by priority; a feature takes the highest-priority class it matches plus any 'stackable' class. Exclusions are applied before classes and always win. Everything here is data: change it and rebuild, no code changes.",
